1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 33=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:45,760
(Arsenic)
Yinxian found this in Xiulai's room.

7
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:50,150
If Lanxiang hadn't acted quickly

8
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,870
and brought Xiulai
back from the Lu family,

9
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,710
by now...

10
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,840
Anyway, after Jinqiao's
wedding tomorrow,

11
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,030
we'll return to Jinling.

12
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,150
You can do whatever you want.

13
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,430
Let's go.

14
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:23,980
(Arsenic)

15
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,150
We'll head back now.

16
00:03:39,470 --> 00:03:40,870
This time, it was all thanks to you.

17
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,120
Otherwise...

18
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,310
I also owe Young Master
thanks for the sedative.

19
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:51,870
It wasn't a sedative.

20
00:03:52,616 --> 00:03:55,032
It was medicine to calm
the nerves and help you sleep.

21
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:57,960
Thank you for the medicine.

22
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,590
Xiulai!

23
00:04:04,750 --> 00:04:06,840
Why is there blood on Xiulai?

24
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:09,750
And when did you learn to set bones?

25
00:04:12,904 --> 00:04:15,080
That was chicken blood
wrapped in sheep intestine.

26
00:04:16,830 --> 00:04:18,720
It's a little trick used onstage.

27
00:04:18,952 --> 00:04:20,600
You still want to leave my Lu family?

28
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:22,920
Blood...

29
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:26,070
I learned a little about setting bones

30
00:04:26,712 --> 00:04:28,390
because I needed it for writing a play.

31
00:04:28,904 --> 00:04:30,360
I don't actually know how to do it,

32
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,870
but it was enough to fool everyone.

33
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:35,070
Xiulai's arm isn't broken?

34
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:37,310
You lied to us?

35
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,190
Xiuwan was crying her eyes out.

36
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,584
Jinqiao nearly went to fight them
in his wedding clothes.

37
00:04:44,750 --> 00:04:45,870
Even I fell for it.

38
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:48,190
I was secretly regretting

39
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,360
only breaking one of Lu Jian's hands.

40
00:04:51,870 --> 00:04:56,480
A convincing performance
must be structured and heartfelt.

41
00:04:56,776 --> 00:04:59,400
According to the Collected Commentaries
on the Laws of Our Dynasty,

42
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:02,240
a husband may divorce his wife,
but a wife may not leave her husband.

43
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,600
If the Lu family refuses,

44
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:08,240
it will be almost impossible
for Xiulai to separate from him.

45
00:05:11,128 --> 00:05:12,920
Since I've taken
this matter upon myself,

46
00:05:13,390 --> 00:05:15,240
I'll not only help Xiulai
separate from him,

47
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:16,750
but I'll also help her

48
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,040
get Yingzhi back from the Lu family.

49
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:21,600
How could...

50
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:27,000
Are you sure?

51
00:05:28,070 --> 00:05:30,000
Why else would I go to all this trouble?

52
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:32,480
For Xiulai and Yingzhi,

53
00:05:32,792 --> 00:05:35,112
I'll have to put everyone
through some inconvenience.

54
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:40,580
♪The golden sunset♪

55
00:05:40,580 --> 00:05:44,060
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

56
00:05:45,580 --> 00:05:48,140
♪All things fall silent♪

57
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:51,620
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

58
00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:55,460
♪My restless heart♪

59
00:05:55,460 --> 00:05:59,260
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

60
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:05,780
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

61
00:06:10,020 --> 00:06:16,632
(List)

62
00:06:16,696 --> 00:06:19,272
Candidates from across the realm
are examined by imperial decree.

63
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:21,990
The top three are awarded the title
of Presented Scholar with Honors.

64
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,720
The second class is awarded
the title of Presented Scholar.

65
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,920
The third class is awarded the title
of Associate Presented Scholar.

66
00:06:28,696 --> 00:06:30,630
(Zhao Chengzhen)
First place in the first class,

67
00:06:30,648 --> 00:06:31,720
Zhao Chengzhen,

68
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,510
from Suizhou, Huguang.

69
00:06:33,510 --> 00:06:34,680
(Wang Shiyu, Han Liang)

70
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:37,600
Second place
in the first class, Wang Shiyu,

71
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,430
from Bao'an Prefecture, Zhili.

72
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:43,390
Third place
in the first class, Han Liang,

73
00:06:43,630 --> 00:06:45,160
from Suzhou, Zhili.

74
00:06:48,728 --> 00:06:50,480
Congratulations, Third Place Scholar.

75
00:06:51,608 --> 00:06:52,750
Congratulations to you too.

76
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,290
Congratulations, Third Place Scholar.

77
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:55,000
Congratulations.

78
00:06:55,272 --> 00:06:57,190
Quite an achievement
at such a young age.

79
00:06:57,190 --> 00:06:59,160
(Zhao Chengzhen, First Place Scholar,
Wang Shiyu, Second Place Scholar)

80
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,190
Sixtieth place goes
to a member of the Xie family.

81
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,750
Congratulations.

82
00:07:13,390 --> 00:07:14,190
Congratulations.

83
00:07:14,270 --> 00:07:15,480
Congratulations to you too.

84
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:18,510
Han is young and talented.

85
00:07:18,856 --> 00:07:20,800
He truly deserves
to be Third Place Scholar.

86
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,920
He surely has a bright future ahead.

87
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:27,360
Xie's future prospects
are beyond anything we can hope for.

88
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:30,870
After all, he has
Grand Secretary Zhao behind him.

89
00:07:35,752 --> 00:07:38,056
The youngest
among the Presented Scholars

90
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:40,190
are Han Liang and Xie Zhao, correct?

91
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,560
Yes, Your Majesty.

92
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:47,800
I find Han Liang composed in his conduct
and attentive to those around him.

93
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,120
He appears to be a promising talent.

94
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,120
(Dai Qing, Zhao Xingtang's Husband,
Third-Rank Minister)

95
00:07:52,136 --> 00:07:53,780
(of the Court
of Imperial Entertainments)

96
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,830
Then let the Third Place Scholar
join the Hanlin Academy

97
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:02,630
as an editor to gain some experience.

98
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,720
Your Majesty is most gracious.

99
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,616
Though Xie Zhao may not compare

100
00:08:08,632 --> 00:08:11,270
with the Third Place Scholar
personally chosen by Your Majesty,

101
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:14,750
passing the imperial examination
at such a young age

102
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:17,240
also shows great promise.

103
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,950
I've heard that Xie Zhao

104
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,270
is Grand Secretary Zhao's
grandson-in-law.

105
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,360
Just as Your Majesty has heard.

106
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:28,510
Grand Secretary Zhao
truly has a discerning eye.

107
00:08:29,750 --> 00:08:34,270
Both grandsons-in-law
you've chosen are exceptional.

108
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:39,030
Thank you for your praise,
Your Majesty. I am humbled.

109
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:43,320
Your Majesty flatters me.
I am unworthy of such praise.

110
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,000
Where's Fengtai?

111
00:08:54,390 --> 00:08:56,000
Why haven't I seen him today?

112
00:08:57,390 --> 00:08:59,030
Deputy Commander Lin took leave today.

113
00:08:59,360 --> 00:08:59,870
But

114
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:02,000
I don't know why.

115
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,790
I...

116
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:06,670
happen to know why.

117
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:10,030
My son Dai Rui serves as
Judicial Officer of Shuntian Prefecture.

118
00:09:10,270 --> 00:09:12,840
Shuntian Prefecture
recently received a complaint.

119
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,000
Right now,

120
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:17,240
Deputy Commander Lin should
be in court over the case.

121
00:09:19,670 --> 00:09:20,870
In court?

122
00:09:24,420 --> 00:09:26,360
(Shuntian Prefecture)

123
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,870
Deputy Commander Lin's eldest sister

124
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,480
married Lu Jian, son of Director Lu

125
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:32,030
of the Construction Office,
Ministry of Works.

126
00:09:32,790 --> 00:09:33,790
Two months ago,

127
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:36,000
Lin sought a separation
from the Lu family.

128
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,750
The local elders mediated several times,

129
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:41,080
but Lin refused to back down.

130
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:43,270
The Lu family
also refused the separation.

131
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,910
So Lin filed a complaint

132
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:48,720
against her husband
with Shuntian Prefecture.

133
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:50,790
(Justice and Impartiality)

134
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:53,120
The Lin family is
seeking another separation.

135
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,240
And this time,
a wife is suing her husband.

136
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,270
(Dai Rui, Dai Qing's Eldest Son, Sixth-Rank
Judicial Officer of Shuntian Prefecture)

137
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,510
This should be interesting.

138
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,080
Indeed.

139
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:01,660
(Prefect Liu,
Third-Rank Prefect of Shuntian)

140
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,840
Lin.

141
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:09,870
Do you understand that a wife must obey
her husband, and that suing him

142
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:12,870
is a violation of moral order?

143
00:10:13,390 --> 00:10:15,240
Whether you win or lose,

144
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,550
under the law,

145
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:20,240
you will receive 100 strokes
and three years of penal servitude.

146
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,390
I understand.

147
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:27,670
If you withdraw your complaint now,

148
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:30,240
this court will not pursue the matter.

149
00:10:30,390 --> 00:10:32,270
But if you insist on proceeding,

150
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:35,960
can you endure the punishment
of 100 strokes and three years

151
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:38,390
of penal servitude?

152
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,600
I insist on proceeding.

153
00:11:00,024 --> 00:11:02,910
100 strokes and three years of
penal servitude are indeed frightening.

154
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,600
But if I don't bring this case today,

155
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:09,960
I could be beaten to death by Lu Jian
and still be condemned for it.

156
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:14,910
Your Honor, I have studied the teachings
of the sages since childhood.

157
00:11:15,352 --> 00:11:17,630
Lin and I have been husband
and wife since our youth.

158
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:20,200
Even if we occasionally argued,

159
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:22,960
how could I ever be so cruel
as to beat her severely?

160
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:27,120
That day, Lin had her brother Lin Jinqi

161
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:31,720
hire men to beat me, and they
even broke one of my hands.

162
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:34,480
I admit I lost my head.

163
00:11:34,670 --> 00:11:38,440
In my anger, I struck Lin.

164
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:44,790
Deputy Commander Lin,

165
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:48,510
is what Lu Jian said true?

166
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:57,750
I discovered

167
00:11:57,870 --> 00:12:00,720
that Lu Jian often beat my sister,

168
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:03,080
so I did have men beat Lu Jian.

169
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:05,032
Later, the Lu family
came to confront me.

170
00:12:05,064 --> 00:12:07,320
We argued, and I lost my temper.

171
00:12:07,750 --> 00:12:10,240
I accidentally broke Lu Jian's hand.

172
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:13,120
But my sister knew nothing
about any of this.

173
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:14,960
It had nothing to do with her.

174
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:20,030
Deputy Commander Lin,
you acted foolishly.

175
00:12:21,790 --> 00:12:23,320
As a court official,

176
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:26,550
you knowingly broke the law
and assaulted a scholar.

177
00:12:27,176 --> 00:12:28,550
The Lin family has gone too far.

178
00:12:29,270 --> 00:12:30,750
How could they assault a scholar?

179
00:12:30,750 --> 00:12:31,510
Lanxiang.

180
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:38,750
I lost my temper
and struck Lin a few times.

181
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:41,360
I never expected her
to take it so seriously

182
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:44,790
and bring such
a trivial matter before the court.

183
00:12:45,270 --> 00:12:48,480
The law states that
when a husband beats his wife,

184
00:12:48,630 --> 00:12:51,480
if no bones are broken,
no charges shall be pursued.

185
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:54,200
To disregard moral order
over a mere quarrel

186
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,600
and sue one's husband

187
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:59,960
is truly a violation of public morals.

188
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:03,030
Judicial Officer Dai has a point.

189
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:06,030
- Why make such a fuss over so little?
- This law is terribly unjust.

190
00:13:06,504 --> 00:13:08,670
My sister has always
been gentle and mild-mannered.

191
00:13:09,910 --> 00:13:12,630
If her husband had merely
struck her a couple of times,

192
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:14,600
why would she seek a separation?

193
00:13:16,150 --> 00:13:16,910
That day,

194
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,630
Lu Jian beat my sister until
she vomited blood and passed out.

195
00:13:20,776 --> 00:13:22,888
An old servant carried
her out of the Lu Residence.

196
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:25,750
The Lu family's servants
and neighbors outside all saw it.

197
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:27,440
We have their testimony as proof.

198
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:37,000
I saw the blood slowly
seeping out with my own eyes.

199
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:37,790
Lin's younger sister

200
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:40,480
was wailing as if someone had died.

201
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,670
We saw it with our own eyes.

202
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:43,320
It's true. There was so much blood.

203
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:44,664
Your Honor, please judge fairly.

204
00:13:46,030 --> 00:13:47,120
Lin is frail,

205
00:13:47,656 --> 00:13:49,030
(Witness)
and quick-tempered.

206
00:13:49,750 --> 00:13:53,360
Her coughing up blood and fainting
had nothing to do with me.

207
00:13:54,270 --> 00:13:56,720
Deputy Commander Lin, are you deaf?

208
00:13:56,870 --> 00:13:59,320
Didn't you hear
what Judicial Officer Dai just said?

209
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:02,456
If a husband
beats his wife without causing

210
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:05,240
a fracture, no charges shall be pursued.

211
00:14:06,408 --> 00:14:07,720
After we returned home that day,

212
00:14:07,730 --> 00:14:10,310
my wife promptly summoned
Imperial Physician Yao to examine her.

213
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:15,200
I found bruising and swelling
three finger-widths below the elbow.

214
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:17,740
Was there anything unusual
about the bone beneath the swelling?

215
00:14:17,750 --> 00:14:21,720
It appeared normal, but there
seemed to be a grating sound.

216
00:14:22,392 --> 00:14:25,190
This is a copy of the medical record
from the Imperial Medical Service.

217
00:14:25,208 --> 00:14:27,360
(Examination, Imperial Physician Yao)
It bears Physician Yao's signature.

218
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,720
If Prefect Liu has any doubts,

219
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:31,080
you may summon
Imperial Physician Yao to testify.

220
00:14:32,390 --> 00:14:33,480
That's impossible.

221
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,480
That's absolutely impossible.

222
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:38,080
The Imperial Medical Service's
record states it clearly.

223
00:14:38,150 --> 00:14:39,600
And you still deny it?

224
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:46,232
Lin and I have been husband and wife

225
00:14:46,248 --> 00:14:47,790
since our youth,
and we have children together.

226
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:49,448
How could I have struck her so severely?

227
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:51,720
I never broke her arm!

228
00:14:51,790 --> 00:14:52,600
Yes.

229
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:54,030
My son told me

230
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:57,720
he always knew
how far to go when he hit Lin.

231
00:14:58,720 --> 00:15:02,200
My son knows the law.
Why would he knowingly break it?

232
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:04,150
Father, be quiet.

233
00:15:04,790 --> 00:15:07,030
He knew how far to go?
So he really did hit her?

234
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,360
That's outrageous.

235
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,030
- He really hit her?
- What a brute!

236
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,720
You knowingly broke the law,

237
00:15:13,768 --> 00:15:16,000
yet you use clever words
and refuse to admit your guilt.

238
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:18,456
All your study of the teachings
of the sages was for nothing.

239
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:21,790
Confess at once,
or you will be severely punished.

240
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,670
Fine, I admit it.

241
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:32,600
I admit I injured Lin.

242
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,750
Lu Jian has admitted
to breaking my sister's arm.

243
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,320
Their marital bond is severed.

244
00:15:38,910 --> 00:15:41,150
I ask Prefect Liu
to grant my sister's request

245
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:43,480
and order their separation.

246
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,960
I admit I lost my head and injured Lin,

247
00:15:52,390 --> 00:15:55,150
but Lin and I married young,
and we have children together.

248
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:58,320
Our children are still young.
How can they be without their mother?

249
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:00,870
No matter how angry Lin is with me,

250
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:03,150
I still refuse to separate from her.

251
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:05,630
I beg Your Honor
to have pity on our young children

252
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,870
and not tear our family apart.

253
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:11,870
What Lu Jian says is reasonable.

254
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:16,670
Better to tear down ten temples
than break up one marriage.

255
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:20,240
Exactly. It's only a little fighting.

256
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:25,720
Marriage is the foundation
of human relations.

257
00:16:26,184 --> 00:16:28,280
First comes the duty
between husband and wife,

258
00:16:28,290 --> 00:16:30,270
and then the affection
between parent and child.

259
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:33,670
Since Lu Jian refuses to separate,

260
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:36,670
Lin shall be returned
to the Lu family today

261
00:16:37,030 --> 00:16:39,150
and remain a wife of the Lu family.

262
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:02,960
Lin.

263
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:07,070
As long as you live,
you belong to the Lu family.

264
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,720
Even in death, you'll still
belong to the Lu family.

265
00:17:18,270 --> 00:17:19,510
For the rest of your life,

266
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:24,200
don't even think of taking
a single step outside the Lu family.

267
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:27,960
Prefect Liu.

268
00:17:35,816 --> 00:17:37,790
I am the eldest daughter-in-law
of the Lin family.

269
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:40,070
Today, I have a complaint

270
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:43,480
accusing Lu Jian of stealing
and seizing the Lin family's property.

271
00:17:44,030 --> 00:17:46,510
You're making baseless accusations
and spreading lies!

272
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:14,790
I ask Prefect Liu to judge fairly.

273
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:28,056
(Plaintiff, Lin Jinqi)

274
00:18:28,104 --> 00:18:30,990
It was only while our First Young Lady
was home recovering that I learned

275
00:18:31,030 --> 00:18:34,240
she had been using her dowry to support
her husband's family all these years.

276
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:36,550
Yet her husband still wasn't satisfied

277
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:38,070
and tried to forcibly seize

278
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:40,920
the Lin family property
that wasn't part of her dowry.

279
00:18:41,336 --> 00:18:42,830
When our First Young Lady refused,

280
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:45,960
her husband punched and kicked her

281
00:18:46,110 --> 00:18:48,070
and even beat his own daughter.

282
00:18:48,110 --> 00:18:49,240
Nonsense!

283
00:18:49,790 --> 00:18:51,750
Those... those were
all part of Lin's dowry.

284
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,310
Before First Young Lady married,

285
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:56,960
the Lin family
was preparing to move back to Jinling.

286
00:18:57,270 --> 00:19:00,440
Since it was inconvenient at the time,
and considering our future needs,

287
00:19:00,790 --> 00:19:02,270
we entrusted part of the property

288
00:19:02,350 --> 00:19:04,550
to our First Young Lady,
who was about to marry,

289
00:19:04,550 --> 00:19:05,750
for safekeeping.

290
00:19:07,350 --> 00:19:08,856
(Dowry List)
This is the dowry list

291
00:19:08,888 --> 00:19:09,992
kept by our family.

292
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:12,640
It clearly states
which items were her dowry

293
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,790
and which were Lin family property

294
00:19:14,830 --> 00:19:16,830
entrusted to our First Young Lady
for safekeeping.

295
00:19:29,030 --> 00:19:30,640
That dowry list is fake!

296
00:19:33,270 --> 00:19:35,510
You're fabricating facts
and misleading everyone.

297
00:19:35,592 --> 00:19:37,480
Those assets were clearly
all part of the dowry.

298
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:44,300
(Lin Family Private Property
Held for Safekeeping)

299
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:47,240
The Lu family has an identical copy
of the dowry list.

300
00:19:47,448 --> 00:19:48,790
Bring it out and compare the two,

301
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:51,550
and you'll see that
every word I've said is true.

302
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:53,550
Lu Jian.

303
00:19:54,350 --> 00:19:57,920
Present the Lin family's
dowry list at once.

304
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,920
You keep saying
these accusations are baseless

305
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,920
and that the evidence was fabricated.

306
00:20:04,550 --> 00:20:07,510
Then why won't you
produce your evidence?

307
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,550
Our First Young Lady said

308
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:12,750
Lu Jian wanted
to take possession of her dowry

309
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,110
and the Lin family's property,

310
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:16,110
so he tore up that list.

311
00:20:19,310 --> 00:20:20,400
More than three years ago,

312
00:20:21,544 --> 00:20:24,424
when Lu Jian tried to take
the jade bracelet Grandmother gave me,

313
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:25,960
I thought

314
00:20:26,510 --> 00:20:29,400
I should at least save something
for my daughter's future dowry,

315
00:20:29,480 --> 00:20:30,750
so I refused to give it to him.

316
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:34,000
He tore up the dowry list.

317
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:35,790
What a despicable man.

318
00:20:35,864 --> 00:20:36,960
He's absolutely heartless.

319
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,750
How shameless.

320
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:41,440
After learning the truth,
we hurried to investigate.

321
00:20:41,750 --> 00:20:42,680
At the pawnshop,

322
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,590
we found property
that belonged to the Lin family.

323
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:49,160
The pawn ticket
even bears Lu Jian's signature.

324
00:20:59,700 --> 00:21:02,180
(150 Taels, Lu Ju)

325
00:21:04,350 --> 00:21:06,830
Here is Lu Ju's signature as well.

326
00:21:07,110 --> 00:21:08,270
Would you like to see it?

327
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,110
How shameless.

328
00:21:10,168 --> 00:21:12,600
Exactly. A father-in-law seized
his daughter-in-law's dowry.

329
00:21:12,696 --> 00:21:14,110
- Yes. How shameless.
- Exactly.

330
00:21:14,110 --> 00:21:15,400
That wasn't her dowry.

331
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:16,920
It was the Lin family's property.

332
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:17,640
Prefect Liu.

333
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:20,550
The Lu family misappropriated
over 3,000 taels

334
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:23,160
of the Lin family's property.

335
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:26,400
What is the penalty under the law?

336
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:30,000
Tattooing the arm for theft,

337
00:21:30,510 --> 00:21:33,480
100 strokes and exile for 1,500 km.

338
00:21:34,070 --> 00:21:36,830
However, this case involves
theft between relatives.

339
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:40,270
Lu Jian is a distant relative
of the Lin family.

340
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:43,368
Therefore, he shall
receive 70 strokes and

341
00:21:43,370 --> 00:21:45,200
two and a half years of penal servitude.

342
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:48,720
Anyone holding scholarly honors
shall be stripped of them.

343
00:21:48,960 --> 00:21:51,590
No! You can't do that.

344
00:22:09,750 --> 00:22:10,480
Your Honor.

345
00:22:13,070 --> 00:22:14,000
I agree to a separation.

346
00:22:17,680 --> 00:22:20,750
As long as... As long as the Lin family
withdraws the complaint,

347
00:22:21,030 --> 00:22:23,310
I will separate from Lin here in court.

348
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:26,200
What about Yingzhi?

349
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,480
Yingzhi...

350
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:42,720
Yingzhi should fulfill
her filial duty to her mother.

351
00:22:46,310 --> 00:22:47,000
Yingzhi...

352
00:22:48,030 --> 00:22:50,310
Yingzhi will naturally be raised by Lin!

353
00:22:51,540 --> 00:22:53,820
♪Those things I can't forget♪

354
00:22:53,820 --> 00:22:58,060
♪The absurdities
I can't let go of fill every page♪

355
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:02,510
Prefect Liu, the Lu family
has agreed to the separation.

356
00:23:03,030 --> 00:23:05,270
The Lin family
is also willing to compromise

357
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,310
and withdraw the complaint.

358
00:23:08,500 --> 00:23:10,860
♪Even when memories hide away♪

359
00:23:11,140 --> 00:23:15,380
♪Silent, they still keep shining♪

360
00:23:15,380 --> 00:23:17,180
♪Burning bright♪

361
00:23:17,540 --> 00:23:20,300
♪That's what made me who I am♪

362
00:23:20,300 --> 00:23:24,300
♪The best years of my life♪

363
00:23:24,980 --> 00:23:28,940
♪Etched into my heart♪

364
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,640
Lanxiang is incredible.

365
00:23:48,550 --> 00:23:52,510
The property dispute between the Lin
and Lu families will not be pursued.

366
00:23:52,830 --> 00:23:53,510
However,

367
00:23:54,350 --> 00:23:55,240
Lu Jian,

368
00:23:56,070 --> 00:23:58,744
for knowingly breaking
the law and fracturing

369
00:23:58,750 --> 00:24:01,030
his wife's bone,
shall receive 100 strokes.

370
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:04,920
Lin, for disregarding moral order

371
00:24:04,930 --> 00:24:07,550
and suing her husband,
shall receive 100 strokes.

372
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:09,790
Lin Jinqi,

373
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:14,310
for assaulting a scholar and causing
a fracture, shall receive 100 strokes.

374
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:16,920
Prefect Liu.

375
00:24:17,128 --> 00:24:18,750
Imperial Physician Yao said my sister

376
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:21,390
suffers from qi and blood deficiency
and still needs to recuperate.

377
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:25,110
Bringing this case against Lu Jian
was entirely my decision.

378
00:24:25,680 --> 00:24:27,920
I am willing to take
all of my sister's punishment.

379
00:24:28,790 --> 00:24:29,550
Jinqi.

380
00:24:34,312 --> 00:24:36,488
After all,
he is a trusted man of His Majesty.

381
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:41,240
Your Honor, you might
as well do him a favor.

382
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:49,270
Deputy Commander Lin,
given your deep devotion to your sister,

383
00:24:49,270 --> 00:24:54,200
Lin is frail, so you may
take her 100 strokes in her place.

384
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:55,720
200 strokes?

385
00:25:02,110 --> 00:25:03,160
Thank you, Prefect Liu.

386
00:25:04,550 --> 00:25:09,960
By order of the Prefect, Deputy
Commander Lin shall receive 200 strokes.

387
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:11,030
- Yes.
- Yes.

388
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:21,110
I'll be fine.

389
00:25:30,510 --> 00:25:31,240
Begin.

390
00:25:33,070 --> 00:25:33,750
Jinqi!

391
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,200
Get up!

392
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:46,480
Jinqi!

393
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,270
Continue.

394
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:59,030
Stop!

395
00:26:04,270 --> 00:26:05,000
How dare you!

396
00:26:06,920 --> 00:26:09,440
Causing a disturbance
in court. Throw her out!

397
00:26:14,104 --> 00:26:15,000
Prefect Liu, are you

398
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:17,000
trying to use this opportunity
to kill my husband?

399
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:19,240
Insolent woman!

400
00:26:19,590 --> 00:26:23,110
How dare you make false accusations
against me in court?

401
00:26:23,680 --> 00:26:26,070
If you cannot justify
your accusation today,

402
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:28,400
I will punish you severely.

403
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:29,720
Come forward.

404
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:38,270
I've seen in plays

405
00:26:38,440 --> 00:26:41,160
that 70 strokes
are enough to kill a man.

406
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:42,328
200 strokes?

407
00:26:42,360 --> 00:26:44,632
Wouldn't that be taking
the opportunity to kill him?

408
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:46,550
- Exactly.
- Exactly.

409
00:26:46,550 --> 00:26:48,830
- Wouldn't 200 strokes beat a man to death?
- Exactly!

410
00:26:48,830 --> 00:26:51,030
The bailiffs of Shuntian Prefecture
are all experienced.

411
00:26:51,030 --> 00:26:52,350
They know how much force to use.

412
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:54,030
Even 200 strokes,

413
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:57,480
or 300, wouldn't kill a man.

414
00:26:57,720 --> 00:26:59,440
Prefect Liu is right.

415
00:26:59,750 --> 00:27:02,232
The bailiffs are experienced.
They know how much force to use.

416
00:27:02,480 --> 00:27:04,590
If 300 strokes can leave a man alive,

417
00:27:04,830 --> 00:27:05,550
then 200 strokes

418
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:08,880
can naturally kill a man, too.

419
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:21,590
Prefect Liu, you and I have worked
together for many years.

420
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:23,510
With everyone watching,

421
00:27:23,680 --> 00:27:27,070
how could I betray
my conscience and do such a thing?

422
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:32,000
Don't listen to
this ignorant woman's nonsense.

423
00:27:32,472 --> 00:27:34,480
Prefect Liu is presiding
over the case today.

424
00:27:34,750 --> 00:27:36,960
If anything happens to my husband,

425
00:27:37,070 --> 00:27:40,056
I'll take the imperial edict and seek
an audience with His Majesty myself.

426
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:48,480
Mister Li.

427
00:27:50,110 --> 00:27:52,830
I'll have to trouble you today.

428
00:28:01,900 --> 00:28:07,100
♪The wind scatters the clouds,
and rain turns to mud♪

429
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:12,000
Deputy Commander Lin, please.

430
00:28:13,420 --> 00:28:17,980
♪Faded ink turns fragrant,
spring rises and summer grows♪

431
00:28:18,340 --> 00:28:21,620
♪As if time itself were flowing♪

432
00:28:21,620 --> 00:28:24,980
♪Pausing, then rewinding♪

433
00:28:26,060 --> 00:28:28,460
♪I watch the long road wind and turn♪

434
00:28:28,460 --> 00:28:31,020
♪Even the clamor falls silent♪

435
00:28:31,590 --> 00:28:32,400
Xiulai.

436
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:37,510
Begin.

437
00:28:37,510 --> 00:28:39,540
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

438
00:28:39,540 --> 00:28:42,260
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

439
00:28:46,200 --> 00:28:47,880
Mercy! Stop hitting!

440
00:28:48,310 --> 00:28:50,400
Instant karma. Serves him right!

441
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:57,790
I'm done playing.

442
00:28:58,040 --> 00:28:59,830
Today's the Confucian
initiation ceremony.

443
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:01,270
Let's go join the festivities.

444
00:29:01,790 --> 00:29:03,110
Xingtang, don't be upset.

445
00:29:03,128 --> 00:29:06,000
We may not have gotten rid
of that ungrateful Lin Jinqi this time,

446
00:29:06,104 --> 00:29:07,416
but he still took 200 strokes.

447
00:29:07,544 --> 00:29:09,060
He'll be suffering for quite a while.

448
00:29:09,176 --> 00:29:10,264
Let's play a little longer.

449
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:13,200
Sixth Sister.

450
00:29:13,624 --> 00:29:16,510
Today's the Confucian initiation
ceremony for the new Presented Scholars.

451
00:29:16,904 --> 00:29:18,952
Your husband finally
passed the examination.

452
00:29:19,510 --> 00:29:21,400
Instead of helping
make arrangements at home,

453
00:29:21,830 --> 00:29:24,400
you came here first thing
in the morning to play chuiwan.

454
00:29:24,568 --> 00:29:27,144
No wonder your mother-in-law
and husband aren't fond of you.

455
00:29:29,512 --> 00:29:31,200
That good-for-nothing came in dead last.

456
00:29:31,590 --> 00:29:32,750
What's there to celebrate?

457
00:29:33,464 --> 00:29:34,960
I've already asked Grandfather.

458
00:29:35,384 --> 00:29:36,712
By now, anyone with any prospects

459
00:29:36,744 --> 00:29:39,120
has already secured a post
through private connections.

460
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:40,350
Only he, despite having

461
00:29:40,408 --> 00:29:42,990
the Zhao family behind him,
has failed to win His Majesty's favor.

462
00:29:43,070 --> 00:29:44,568
He still hasn't been offered a post.

463
00:29:46,104 --> 00:29:47,750
Securing an official post is never easy.

464
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:51,440
You shouldn't put too much pressure
on the Xie family either.

465
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:55,750
That shabby Xie residence is tiny.

466
00:29:56,310 --> 00:29:57,440
How can anyone live there?

467
00:29:58,216 --> 00:30:00,510
I want to separate
from that good-for-nothing Xie Zhao

468
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:02,550
and have Grandfather
find me a better husband.

469
00:30:02,824 --> 00:30:04,456
Then whenever I want to play chuiwan,

470
00:30:04,460 --> 00:30:06,232
I won't have to trouble you
by coming here.

471
00:30:07,790 --> 00:30:08,830
That's true.

472
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:12,310
Rather than marry
a young man like Xie Zhao

473
00:30:12,400 --> 00:30:14,550
who has neither wealth nor status,

474
00:30:15,350 --> 00:30:16,920
you'd be better off marrying a widower

475
00:30:17,016 --> 00:30:19,510
who already holds high office
and enjoys a generous salary.

476
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,590
Forget it. I'm done playing.

477
00:30:31,816 --> 00:30:33,990
If you want to watch
the Confucian initiation ceremony,

478
00:30:34,070 --> 00:30:35,310
I'll go with you.

479
00:30:37,272 --> 00:30:38,310
Get the carriage ready.

480
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:39,510
No need.

481
00:30:40,360 --> 00:30:42,640
The ceremony procession
will depart from the Imperial Palace

482
00:30:42,650 --> 00:30:44,470
and go to the Temple
of the Sage to make offerings.

483
00:30:44,488 --> 00:30:46,950
No horses or sedan chairs are allowed
on the main street today.

484
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:48,904
Even with a carriage,
we wouldn't get anywhere.

485
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:50,030
Walking would be easier.

486
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:52,110
Then let's walk.

487
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:58,300
Third Place Scholar!
Look, the Third Place Scholar!

488
00:31:59,590 --> 00:32:00,920
What a fine-looking young man.

489
00:32:25,070 --> 00:32:25,750
Congratulations.

490
00:32:25,750 --> 00:32:30,340
♪You're a lone traveler
returning through the snow♪

491
00:32:33,340 --> 00:32:40,580
♪Let me brush the dust of your journey
from your shoulders♪

492
00:32:42,980 --> 00:32:46,940
♪If you're the silent fragrance
of a secluded orchid♪

493
00:32:47,820 --> 00:32:52,140
♪Lingering through every dawn
and dusk at the end of time♪

494
00:32:52,780 --> 00:32:59,900
♪Deep within the lights lies
a truth that came too late♪

495
00:33:02,180 --> 00:33:06,820
♪Though these trials
may have cost me a lifetime♪

496
00:33:06,820 --> 00:33:11,380
♪I only return to the moment
where our fate began♪

497
00:33:11,740 --> 00:33:15,180
♪I've searched and searched,
wandering in circles♪

498
00:33:15,180 --> 00:33:18,100
♪Yet I can never mend that old dream♪

499
00:33:18,100 --> 00:33:21,220
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

500
00:33:21,220 --> 00:33:25,820
♪Thankfully, these trials
have spared me a lifetime♪

501
00:33:25,820 --> 00:33:30,540
♪In this life and the next,
it will always be you♪

502
00:33:31,780 --> 00:33:41,340
♪I only pray that fate
lets us meet sooner♪

503
00:34:05,550 --> 00:34:07,960
I hear the Third Place Scholar
isn't betrothed yet.

504
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,630
Mother isn't here,

505
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:11,360
so I've finally had a few peaceful days.

506
00:34:11,480 --> 00:34:13,576
Don't bring up
the one thing I'd rather not hear.

507
00:34:20,960 --> 00:34:21,590
Xiulai.

508
00:34:21,880 --> 00:34:24,000
Yuchan has already taken
some people to fetch Yingzhi.

509
00:34:24,190 --> 00:34:25,000
When we get back,

510
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,190
you'll be able to see Yingzhi.

511
00:34:27,320 --> 00:34:28,480
Thank you, Lanxiang.

512
00:34:30,510 --> 00:34:33,440
I know you can't
stop worrying about Jun,

513
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:36,030
but fortunately, Jun is already eight.

514
00:34:36,400 --> 00:34:38,000
He spends his days studying at school.

515
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:42,190
Later, we'll find a community school
where he can board

516
00:34:42,200 --> 00:34:44,310
and entrust him to a teacher
who will guide him well.

517
00:34:44,320 --> 00:34:45,920
You'll still have chances to see him.

518
00:34:59,670 --> 00:35:01,840
Young Master, it's all my fault.

519
00:35:02,150 --> 00:35:04,440
I forgot to check the almanac
before going out.

520
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:29,590
How heartless.

521
00:35:31,150 --> 00:35:32,480
I'm already injured,

522
00:35:33,192 --> 00:35:34,960
yet she won't even
come to keep me company.

523
00:35:35,448 --> 00:35:37,320
I said I didn't want
a maid looking after me.

524
00:35:38,150 --> 00:35:39,400
I never said I didn't want her.

525
00:36:24,800 --> 00:36:26,320
Didn't you take pain medicine?

526
00:36:26,510 --> 00:36:27,480
Why does it still hurt?

527
00:36:28,760 --> 00:36:32,480
I can't sleep. Stay and talk with me.

528
00:36:33,710 --> 00:36:35,360
Maybe then it won't hurt anymore.

529
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:00,480
What do you want to talk about?

530
00:37:05,360 --> 00:37:06,880
In court today,

531
00:37:08,320 --> 00:37:11,030
were you afraid Dai Rui
would seize the chance

532
00:37:11,336 --> 00:37:12,590
to have me beaten to death?

533
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:20,550
You knew Dai Rong's brother
was in court.

534
00:37:21,030 --> 00:37:22,590
How could you not have prepared for it?

535
00:37:24,070 --> 00:37:25,320
I guessed you intended

536
00:37:25,320 --> 00:37:27,360
to take a few real strokes,

537
00:37:27,590 --> 00:37:29,030
so you'd have solid evidence

538
00:37:29,190 --> 00:37:31,840
to confront Dai Rui in court.

539
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:35,480
Prefect Liu
is the Duke of Ying's brother-in-law.

540
00:37:36,190 --> 00:37:37,590
He may not side with you,

541
00:37:37,608 --> 00:37:39,736
but he certainly won't side
with Prince Han either.

542
00:37:40,760 --> 00:37:41,630
Then

543
00:37:42,070 --> 00:37:44,760
you could not only eliminate
an enemy of your own,

544
00:37:45,590 --> 00:37:49,110
but also help His Majesty keep Prince
Han in check. Two birds with one stone.

545
00:37:51,630 --> 00:37:54,400
Since you knew I had other plans,

546
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:57,190
why did you step in to protect me?

547
00:37:58,880 --> 00:38:02,110
Your concerns are always about
either His Majesty or Prince Han.

548
00:38:03,440 --> 00:38:06,670
My concern was Xiulai.

549
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:14,800
She worries too much,

550
00:38:14,952 --> 00:38:16,632
and it has already harmed her health.

551
00:38:17,110 --> 00:38:19,510
If I were badly injured
because of her separation,

552
00:38:21,630 --> 00:38:24,760
she would surely lose sleep and
appetite, making her condition worse.

553
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:29,960
After a woman separates from her
husband, she feels anxious and helpless,

554
00:38:30,248 --> 00:38:32,360
fearing that her own family
may reject her as well.

555
00:38:33,630 --> 00:38:34,960
If First Madam found out

556
00:38:35,230 --> 00:38:37,480
that you were badly injured
because of Xiulai,

557
00:38:38,840 --> 00:38:41,510
she might take her anger out on Xiulai.

558
00:38:45,320 --> 00:38:46,630
I didn't think it through.

559
00:38:47,670 --> 00:38:50,070
Thank you for considering
everything on my behalf.

560
00:38:54,230 --> 00:38:55,320
I stepped in

561
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:56,760
and disrupted your plans.

562
00:38:57,190 --> 00:38:58,630
I'm just glad you don't blame me.

563
00:39:02,190 --> 00:39:03,960
I truly owe you my thanks this time.

564
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:07,030
I had no idea before

565
00:39:07,190 --> 00:39:09,752
that it was so difficult for a woman
to obtain a separation.

566
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:12,000
Fortunately, you came prepared

567
00:39:12,840 --> 00:39:15,480
and gave them
a taste of their own medicine.

568
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:19,230
I merely lent a little support.

569
00:39:19,670 --> 00:39:22,110
What mattered was that Xiulai
had made up her mind

570
00:39:22,280 --> 00:39:23,800
and didn't hesitate any longer.

571
00:39:28,320 --> 00:39:29,630
How are you so familiar with

572
00:39:29,928 --> 00:39:32,056
Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees?

573
00:39:34,150 --> 00:39:36,230
Even many serious scholars

574
00:39:36,488 --> 00:39:39,064
might not have read it carefully
from beginning to end.

575
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:42,070
I need it for writing plays.

576
00:39:43,150 --> 00:39:45,480
If I'm writing about someone who's ill,

577
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:48,250
I need to write scenes about
getting medicine and seeing a physician.

578
00:39:48,590 --> 00:39:49,800
If there's an official,

579
00:39:49,800 --> 00:39:51,672
I need to write lines
about official affairs.

580
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:52,360
Right now,

581
00:39:52,480 --> 00:39:55,150
I'm writing about a woman
suing for a separation,

582
00:39:55,360 --> 00:39:57,000
so I looked through the relevant laws.

583
00:39:57,510 --> 00:40:00,000
I never expected
they'd come in handy for Xiulai.

584
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:02,440
Hearing you put it that way,

585
00:40:03,704 --> 00:40:05,280
writing plays sounds quite interesting.

586
00:40:07,030 --> 00:40:08,150
It is.

587
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:29,880
As for the laws,

588
00:40:30,152 --> 00:40:32,344
you can understand them
by reading the books.

589
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:34,230
But when it comes to court affairs,

590
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:36,960
how can you see those so clearly too?

591
00:40:41,360 --> 00:40:43,000
Jiugao is a shrewd man,

592
00:40:43,096 --> 00:40:45,400
yet even he failed to discover
that the maritime merchant

593
00:40:45,432 --> 00:40:47,208
Qi Sihai had the Dai family behind him.

594
00:40:47,590 --> 00:40:49,880
Clearly, after Dai Rong's death,

595
00:40:50,150 --> 00:40:53,150
the Dai family didn't stop
amassing wealth for Prince Han.

596
00:40:53,440 --> 00:40:55,360
They simply hid it better.

597
00:40:55,784 --> 00:40:58,360
It's been over a thousand years since
Grand Historian Sima Qian

598
00:40:58,630 --> 00:41:00,400
wrote Records of the Grand Historian.

599
00:41:01,070 --> 00:41:02,630
Of everything happening now,

600
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:05,590
what hasn't happened before in history?

601
00:41:06,888 --> 00:41:09,360
There's not even any need
to consult the history books.

602
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:11,360
What Prince Han wants to do now

603
00:41:11,640 --> 00:41:13,704
is simply follow
his father's example and rebel...

604
00:41:21,710 --> 00:41:22,800
Doesn't it hurt?

605
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:50,440
I was wrong this time.

606
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:53,000
It won't happen again.

607
00:41:55,590 --> 00:41:58,000
I hadn't arranged
a post for Lu Jian before

608
00:41:58,710 --> 00:42:01,000
because Prince Han
still hadn't left for his fief.

609
00:42:01,160 --> 00:42:03,000
With the situation
at court still uncertain,

610
00:42:03,320 --> 00:42:05,000
I didn't want to drag him into it.

611
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:06,880
I never expected that, by sheer chance,

612
00:42:07,590 --> 00:42:09,400
his true nature would be exposed.

613
00:42:14,984 --> 00:42:16,400
Aunt Lingxiao keeps complaining

614
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:19,096
that you haven't given enough thought
to Xiuwan's marriage.

615
00:42:19,590 --> 00:42:23,150
It seems you also planned to wait
until Prince Han left for his fief.

616
00:42:26,590 --> 00:42:29,190
You know me best, my lady.

617
00:42:37,440 --> 00:42:40,400
His Majesty is more merciful
than the late Emperor.

618
00:42:41,920 --> 00:42:43,400
I hope Prince Han

619
00:42:44,880 --> 00:42:46,400
can let go of his ambitions.

620
00:42:53,000 --> 00:42:54,320
The pain medicine is working now.

621
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:56,320
Get some rest.

622
00:43:04,900 --> 00:43:07,300
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

623
00:43:17,080 --> 00:43:18,590
Young Master, what are you doing here?

624
00:43:20,190 --> 00:43:21,230
Don't you want to ask

625
00:43:23,110 --> 00:43:24,230
what I'm wishing for?

626
00:43:28,150 --> 00:43:29,590
Whatever you wish for,

627
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:31,230
I hope your wish comes true.

628
00:43:34,480 --> 00:43:35,280
Today

629
00:43:35,630 --> 00:43:36,760
is your birthday.

630
00:43:37,224 --> 00:43:39,400
We were on the boat
for your birthday last year

631
00:43:39,512 --> 00:43:41,000
and couldn't celebrate it properly.

632
00:43:41,710 --> 00:43:42,280
This year,

633
00:43:42,856 --> 00:43:44,888
I came back early,
especially to be with you

634
00:43:45,240 --> 00:43:47,176
and give you
a proper birthday celebration.

635
00:44:04,501 --> 00:44:08,621
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

636
00:44:11,461 --> 00:44:15,981
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

637
00:44:17,261 --> 00:44:21,181
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

638
00:44:21,861 --> 00:44:24,621
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

639
00:44:25,341 --> 00:44:27,661
♪Though all the world may fade♪

640
00:44:27,661 --> 00:44:30,741
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

641
00:44:32,261 --> 00:44:36,501
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

642
00:44:39,421 --> 00:44:43,581
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

643
00:44:45,381 --> 00:44:48,941
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

644
00:44:48,941 --> 00:44:52,501
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

645
00:44:53,301 --> 00:44:58,981
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

646
00:44:59,341 --> 00:45:03,661
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

647
00:45:04,021 --> 00:45:06,981
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

648
00:45:06,981 --> 00:45:10,741
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

649
00:45:10,741 --> 00:45:13,621
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

650
00:45:13,621 --> 00:45:17,701
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

651
00:45:17,701 --> 00:45:21,061
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

652
00:45:21,061 --> 00:45:24,821
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

653
00:45:24,821 --> 00:45:28,821
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

654
00:45:29,581 --> 00:45:33,741
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

655
00:45:33,741 --> 00:45:37,181
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

656
00:45:37,181 --> 00:45:40,821
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

657
00:45:40,821 --> 00:45:43,701
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

658
00:45:43,701 --> 00:45:47,781
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

659
00:45:47,781 --> 00:45:51,141
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

660
00:45:51,141 --> 00:45:54,781
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

661
00:45:54,781 --> 00:46:02,581
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
